{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07005","headline":"早过临淮 · 陶翰","name":"早过临淮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜来三渚风，晨过临淮岛。\n湖中海气白，城上楚云早。\n鳞鳞鱼浦帆，漭漭芦洲草。\n川路日浩荡，惄焉心如捣。\n且言任倚伏，何暇念枯槁。\n范子名屡移，蘧公志常保。\n古人去已久，此理今难道。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07005.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07005","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}